        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 83d15b15-9e2c-4824-adeb-4449ccbc4e54).Image",
        "Description": "47, you have been tasked with taking out a ring of terorrists and smugglers currently taking shelter in hokkaido. Your first target, Jason Portman, is currently seeking cosmetic surgery for his burn scars. Being the leader of the group he has many insider guards scattered throughout the facility, notably the surgeon general and lowly guardener are producing and smuggling weapons and ellicit substances and offshoring them to the andaman sea. It is vital that they do not make it out alive 47.",
